  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Now using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
